{"4877890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Touhou Russian Roulette", "steam_appid": 4877890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remilia's cake has vanished from a locked room in the Scarlet Devil Mansion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras/c709fa5a3e14663fa49135ce6aeab1d4.avif?t=1783954456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras_big/c709fa5a3e14663fa49135ce6aeab1d4.avif?t=1783954456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a late-night tea party hosted by head maid Sakuya. On the table sit tea, cake, and — a single shotgun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single shotgun is loaded with a random mix of blanks and live rounds. At the start of each round the NUMBER of shells is revealed, but their ORDER stays hidden. You'll have to rely on luck, memory, and reading your opponent to pull the trigger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Shoot your opponent</strong> — a live round deals damage; a blank passes the turn.</li><li><strong>Shoot yourself</strong> — a blank keeps your turn for another action! But if it's live…</li><li>Remembering which shells have fired and <strong>calculating the remaining odds</strong> is the key to victory.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras/394d267163af51b19cc3594fc6065f6f.avif?t=1783954456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras_big/394d267163af51b19cc3594fc6065f6f.avif?t=1783954456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items Handed Out Each Round</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, items are there to help you — handed out at random each round. Sakuya lifts the silver cloche to reveal them, and carries out every effect herself, with the utmost elegance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>🍭 <strong>Lollipop</strong> — Restore 1 HP</li><li>🫖 <strong>Teapot</strong> — Eject the currently chambered shell</li><li>🗡️ <strong>Dagger</strong> — Skip the opponent's next turn</li><li>🔍 <strong>Magic Monocle</strong> — Reveal whether the current shell is live or blank</li><li>📛 <strong>Curse Seal</strong> — +1 damage on the next live round</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras/9d68c8d70e67c55cfa36be88c9522700.avif?t=1783954456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras_big/9d68c8d70e67c55cfa36be88c9522700.avif?t=1783954456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Punish the Suspects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koakuma → Hong Meiling → Patchouli → and the boss, Flandre. Face the residents of the Scarlet Devil Mansion one by one in a tournament, and survive to the end to find the cake thief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 3D turn-based roulette built on a live-vs-blank battle of wits</li><li>Get hit and you take stars and <strong>&gt;&lt;</strong> instead of blood — cute, comedic SD characters</li><li>A third-person view that shows the reactions of all three characters — player, opponent, and host</li><li>The gothic tea-room atmosphere and sound of the Scarlet Devil Mansion</li><li>A variety of challenges to unlock (achievements)</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remilia's cake has vanished from a locked room in the Scarlet Devil Mansion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras/c709fa5a3e14663fa49135ce6