strong>Curse Seal</strong> — +1 damage on the next live round</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras/9d68c8d70e67c55cfa36be88c9522700.avif?t=1783954456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/extras_big/9d68c8d70e67c55cfa36be88c9522700.avif?t=1783954456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Punish the Suspects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koakuma → Hong Meiling → Patchouli → and the boss, Flandre. Face the residents of the Scarlet Devil Mansion one by one in a tournament, and survive to the end to find the cake thief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 3D turn-based roulette built on a live-vs-blank battle of wits</li><li>Get hit and you take stars and <strong>&gt;&lt;</strong> instead of blood — cute, comedic SD characters</li><li>A third-person view that shows the reactions of all three characters — player, opponent, and host</li><li>The gothic tea-room atmosphere and sound of the Scarlet Devil Mansion</li><li>A variety of challenges to unlock (achievements)</li></ul>", "short_description": "Remilia's cake has vanished from a locked room in the Scarlet Devil Mansion! With the help of head maid Sakuya, play Russian roulette with a 12-gauge shotgun and punish the suspects. Good luck!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/cb32067b3be69453f4c27e3cf251e18795933a69/header.jpg?t=1783954456", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877890/3138f